STUDENT dapat memecahkan pertanyaan aljabar dalam kalimat bahasa Inggris seperti "The sum of two numbers of 96, and one of the numbers is 16 larger than the other number. Find the two numbers." akan menghasilkan jawaban seperti "One of the numbers is 56. The other number is 40."
